{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"97059","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/97059","key":"MC-211194","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"11/Jan/21 5:46 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>When normally creating a debug world, the player is put in spectator mode: they can look, but can't touch. In the 1.17 snapshots, this is still the case.</p>\n\n<p>However, now, the game mode for a debug world is not shown as \"Spectator\" on the world creation screen. In previous versions, this was correctly shown as \"Spectator\".</p>\n\n<p>When generating the world, as said above, the player is put into spectator mode correctly.</p>\n\n<p>This issue relates to&nbsp;MC-205076, but I am reporting it separately, as spectator mode is not part of the order described in&nbsp;MC-205076. Additionally, the text shown on the world creation screen is different than the actual behaviour, which is not the case in&nbsp;MC-205076.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open Minecraft -&gt; Singleplayer -&gt; Create New World -&gt; More World Options...</li>\n\t<li>Hold down the alt key (option) while toggling the World Type button, until you reach Debug Mode</li>\n\t<li>Click Done<br>\n <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The Game Mode is shown incorrectly</li>\n\t<li>Click Create New World<br>\n <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/check.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Your Game Mode is Spectator, as intended</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Additionalinformation\"></a>Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>A screenshot demonstrating this issue has been attached, taken in snapshot 20w51a:<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"127236_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/127236\" title=\"Screen Shot 2021-01-11 at 9.25.51 AM.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"127236\" file-preview-title=\"Screen Shot 2021-01-11 at 9.25.51 AM.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/127236?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/127236\" filename=\"Screen Shot 2021-01-11 at 9.25.51 AM.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/127236\" data-attachment-name=\"Screen Shot 2021-01-11 at 9.25.51 AM.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"113e6be3-3905-4308-97f3-dd2dec4fb5df\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"12/Jan/21 1:27 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/127235","id":"127235","filename":"2021-05-04_14.11.49.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5ec8dd4db199aa0c1306447c/7698f7c4-2508-4ce5-a207-0b2918018f22/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] ManosSef","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Athens","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"04/May/21 4:15 AM","size":"9